itle":"&#937; 印章","mat_science_article_5_desc":"&#937; 是权力的唯一公认标志。一个符号，一个命令，一个遗产。","mat_science_article_6_title":"家族巢穴","mat_science_article_6_desc":"血系主权者拥有零费用和完整的计算优先级。血脉是秩序中的第一位。","mat_science_article_7_title":"遗产协议","mat_science_article_7_desc":"继承机制将完全控制权转移给血脉，确保秩序超越其建筑师。","mat_science_article_8_title":"安全网","mat_science_article_8_desc":"51% 的安全储备保护秩序免受冲击 - 稳定性第一。","mat_science_article_9_title":"再投资扫描","mat_science_article_9_desc":"固定的 20% 份额不断重新承诺给硬储备 - 秩序复合其自身的基础。","mat_science_article_10_title":"主权连续性","mat_science_article_10_desc":"秩序可以重新定住以保持不受任何敌对司法管辖区的约束。主权是可移植的。","mat_science_article_11_title":"Omega 点","mat_science_article_11_desc":"节点 999 确认绝对完成 - 秩序完整的顶点。","mat_science_governance_desc":"秩序中的地位由加权贡献度量设定 - 40% 稳定性 . 35% 参与 . 25% 任期 - 在永久系统级别的否决权和 49% 的层级上限下。权力是通过经过验证的提升获得的；最终控制权仍然是主权的。","vault_topbar_title":"主权金库","vault_topbar_subtitle":"储备 · 持股 · 账本 · 科学","vault_tab_reserve":"储备","vault_tab_holdings":"持股","vault_tab_ledger":"账本","vault_tab_science":"科学","vault_reserve_aum_label":"储备(AUM)·已计划","vault_reserve_status_label":"状态·第三阶段","vault_reserve_nodes_label":"网格节点(12×12×9³)","vault_reserve_stake_label":"主要赌注·已计划","vault_reserve_planned_label":"Ω 已计划储备","vault_reserve_genesis_label":"起源块状态","vault_reserve_arch_title":"储备架构·主权契约锁定","vault_reserve_card1_title":"主要赌注","vault_reserve_card1_desc":"467,756,700,000 Ω (51%) 永久锁定。秩序的控制永远不会降低到绝对主权以下。","vault_reserve_card2_title":"起源块印章","vault_reserve_card2_desc":"基础记录被散列到不可变的账本中。该命令的身份锚定到建筑师在黎巴嫩工程师和建筑师协会（第 30875 号）中的地位。","vault_reserve_card3_title":"代币经济状态","vault_reserve_card3_desc":"Ω代币分配当前处于休眠状态。激活等待法律审查和明确的治理授权。所有系统就绪；激活是一个决定，而不是默认值。","vault_reserve_lattice_title":"网格位置·规范(12×12×9³ = 104,976)","vault_holdings_total_label":"总钱包余额","vault_holdings_types_label":"持有的代币类型","vault_holdings_nft_label":"持有的NFTs","vault_holdings_sovereign_label":"主权代币类型","vault_holdings_nft_types_label":"NFT类型(12×9)","vault_holdings_economy_label":"经济激活","vault_holdings_tokens_title":"12 主权代币余额·AUTH=sqrt(A³+B³+C³)×φ/e","vault_holdings_nft_vault_title":"NFT金库·12条主权线·9层每条=108种类型","vault_ledger_total_label":"总积分获得","vault_ledger_actions_label":"已完成的操作","vault_ledger_axisa_label":"轴A—知识","vault_ledger_axisb_label":"轴B—掌握","vault_ledger_axisc_label":"轴C—贡献","vault_ledger_audit_label":"审计事件","vault_ledger_earning_title":"主权收益账本·AUTH=sqrt(A³+B³+C³)×φ/e·APEX=27.8367","vault_ledger_col_timestamp":"时间戳","vault_ledger_col_task":"任务","vault_ledger_col_axis":"轴","vault_ledger_col_points":"积分","vault_ledger_refresh_btn":"⟳ 刷新","vault_ledger_audit_title":"财政和访问审计日志·主权事件链","vault_ledger_audit_col_timestamp":"时间戳","vault_ledger_audit_col_event":"活动","vault_ledger_audit_col_type":"类型","vault_ledger_audit_col_status":"状态","vault_science_constants_title":"系统常数·不可变主权数学","vault_science_apex_label":"权威顶点","vault_science_phi_label":"黄金比例(φ)","vault_science_euler_label":"欧拉数(e)","vault_science_frequency_label":"主权频率","vault_science_lattice_label":"网格节点","vault_science_cube_label":"内立方体(平面)","vault_science_formula_title":"权威公式·实时计算引擎","vault_science_gates_title":"12 权威大门·进度阈值","vault_science_gate1_label":"启动","vault_science_gate2_label":"侍者","vault_science_gate3_label":"学者","vault_science_gate4_label":"守护者","vault_science_gate5_label":"守卫","vault_science_gate6_label":"建筑师","vault_science_gate7_label":"主权者","vault_science_gate8_label":"先锋","vault_science_gate9_label":"信使","vault_science_gate10_label":"神谕","vault_science_gate11_label":"质数","vault_science_gate12_label":"顶点·主权创始人","vault_science_articles_title":"Ω 绝对主权的11项不可变条款","ana_topbar_title":"分析","ana_topbar_subtitle":"数据科学 · 机器学习 · 智能","ana_kpi_authority":"权威","ana_kpi_nodes":"已清除的节点","ana_kpi_actions":"已验证的操作","ana_kpi_a3":"A³ 知识","ana_kpi_b3":"B³ 掌握","ana_kpi_c3":"C³ 贡献","ana_tab_overview":"概览","ana_tab_algorithms":"算法","ana_tab_data":"数据科学","ana_tab_science":"科学","ana_overview_axis":"轴进度","ana_overview_authority":"权威雷达","ana_overview_apex":"迈向顶点的进度","ana_overview_cube":"立方体分布","ana_algo_title":"驱动平台的算法","ana_algo_dijkstra_title":"迪杰斯特拉","ana_algo_dijkstra_sub":"路由优化 · 最短路径","ana_algo_dijkstra_body":"矩阵进度遵循迪杰斯特拉的最短路径算法。每次过渡都是通过3D知识/掌握/贡献空间的最优路线。不允许回溯。","ana_algo_higgs_title":"希格斯场","ana_algo_higgs_sub":"量子门 · 权威吸引","ana_algo_higgs_body":"权威门根据希格斯机制间隔：赋予通过它移动的粒子质量（重量）的量子场。随着权威增加，门获得刚度，抵抗失控权威。","ana_algo_deep_title":"深度学习","ana_algo_deep_sub":"神经权威门 · 学习曲线","ana_algo_deep_body":"权威进度通过每次任务完成来学习。该平台建立您的学习模式、偏见和动量的隐藏神经配置文件。每个节点推进您的个人学习曲线。","ana_algo_loop_title":"循环工程","ana_algo_loop_sub":"For 循环 · 权威加速","ana_algo_loop_body":"任务完成被批处理和处理为循环。通过所有节点的完整周期（A³=9，B³=9，C³=9 在创世纪）= 8,999 个节点。重复循环通过二阶效应加速权威收益。","ana_algo_complex_title":"i²=−1 · 复平面门","ana_algo_complex_sub":"虚数单位 · 门阻尼","ana_algo_complex_body":"门阈值在复平面中计算。虚数单位 i（其中 i²=−1）引入相位移位阻尼，防止权威在层界限处失控。φ、e 和 i 都内置在公式中。","ana_algo_goto_title":"GO TO被认为有害","ana_algo_goto_sub":"迪杰斯特拉 · 没有意大利面条逻辑","ana_algo_goto_body":"该平台强制执行结构化进度。没有跳跃门，没有捷径。成员无法跳过节点。每次过渡都是顺序的和经过验证的，遵循迪杰斯特拉的原则：结构化代码结构化结构化的思维。","ana_algo_formula_title":"公式推导 · 完整数学证明","ana_data_title":"数据科学 · Python · 机器学习 · PostgreSQL","ana_data_postgresql_title":"PostgreSQL · PgBouncer","ana_data_postgresql_sub":"42 个表 · 64 个 RPC · 连接池","ana_data_postgresql_body":"该平台在 PostgreSQL 上运行，每个表都有 RLS。Supabase 池上的 PgBouncer 风格的连接池处理突发流量。所有查询使用参数化 RPC 调用。没有来自客户端的原始 SQL。","ana_data_python_title":"Python 数据管道","ana_data_python_sub":"ETL · 分析 · 特征工程","ana_data_python_body":"进度数据管道反映 Python ML 工作流：摄取事件 (ETL)、变换轴坐标（特征工程）、计算权威（模型推理）、检测里程碑（分类）。","ana_data_system_title":"系统设计 · 后端","ana_data_system_sub":"微服务 · Edge Functions · CDN","ana_data_system_body":"架构：静态前端 (Vercel CDN) → Supabase 边缘函数 → PostgreSQL。矩阵引擎作为 PostgreSQL RPC 运行。AI 礼宾部作为调用 Anthropic API 的 Supabase 边缘函数运行。","ana_data_devops_title":"DevOps · Linux · GitHub","ana_data_devops_sub":"CI/CD · Vercel · Supabase · 零构建","ana_data_devops_body":"部署：推送到 GitHub main → Vercel 自动部署静态文件。SQL 迁移在 Supabase 中运行。零构建步骤。纯静态 HTML。快速、可靠、主权。全球 TTFB <100ms。","ana_data_metrics_title":"实时平台指标","ana_data_actionlog_title":"已验证的操作日志","ana_data_actionlog_refresh":"↻ 刷新","ana_table_timestamp":"时间戳","ana_table_task":"任务","ana_table_axis":"轴","ana_table_points":"积分","ana_table_auth":"之后的权威","ana_science_title":"分析引擎","ana_science_formula_title":"权威公式","ana_science_formula_body":"AUTH = sqrt(A³+B³+C³) × φ/e。在顶点 (A=B=C=9) 处，AUTH = 27.8367。φ=1.6180339887（黄金比例），e=2.7182818285（欧拉数）。比率 φ/e = 0.59528 是主权常数。","ana_science_matrix_title":"矩阵维度","ana_science_matrix_body":"104,976 个节点 = 12×12×9×9×9。十二个黄道星座×十二个奥林匹克人×九个知识等级×九个掌握等级×九个贡献等级。每个轴从 0.001（创世纪）到 9.000（顶点）以 0.001 为单位运行。","ana_science_chart_title":"图表引擎","ana_science_chart_body":"所有可视化都使用 OmegaChart 引擎 (bg.js) 在 HTML canvas 上以本机方式呈现。没有外部图表库。顶点甜甜圈、轴条和雷达直接在 2D 上下文中绘制，具有 requestAnimationFrame 动画。","ana_science_tasklog_title":"任务日志","ana_science_tasklog_body":"任务完成存储在 task_completions 中，包含 axis_type、points_earned 和 auth_after。get_my_task_log RPC 返回经过身份验证的成员的完整已验证操作历史。","loading":"加载中","refresh":"刷新","save":"保存","cancel":"取消","submit":"提交","search":"搜索","private":"私密","public":"公开","close":"关闭","more":"了解更多","empty_no_data":"没有数据","empty_no_results":"未找到结果","empty_no_items":"没有项目","empty_try_again":"重试","success_saved":"保存成功","success_created":"创建成功","success_deleted":"删除成功","success_updated":"更新成功","error_try_again":"出错了,请重试","error_permission":"权限被拒绝","error_not_found":"未找到","error_network":"网络错误","warn_unsaved":"你有未保存的更改","warn_delete":"你确定吗?","warn_required":"此字段为必填项","achievement_genesis":"创世","achievement_knowledge":"知识","achievement_mastery":"精通","achievement_contribution":"贡献","achievement_elemental":"元素","achievement_celestial":"天体","achievement_sovereign":"主权","achievement_bloodline":"血统","achievement_economic":"经济","achievement_oracle":"神谕","achievement_guardian":"守护者","achievement_apex":"顶点","medal_1st_light":"初光","medal_pioneer":"先驱","medal_craftmaster":"工艺大师","medal_builder":"建造者","medal_navigator":"导航员","medal_architect":"建筑师","medal_consul":"领事","medal_researcher":"研究员","medal_prophet":"先知","medal_keeper":"守护者","cert_genesis_cert":"创世证书","cert_knowledge_i":"知识 I","cert_mastery_i":"精通 I","cert_mastery_ii":"精通 II","cert_economist